'''Stainless''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 3]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
The whole knife consists of a monochromatic gradient; the blade and handle both start at a light gray and end in a solid black. The guard is half light gray, half solid black.





